{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.poster.avif?t=1772996424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.webm?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.mp4?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of an anxious cactus artist named Prickles. Prickles is in a mentally dark place and faces eviction, but one call from her estranged aunt Big Red changes all of that. Prickles moves to a new apartment with the help of her aunt, hopefully to piece her life back together again. Prickles can help herself and the odd residents of the apartment complex through making and sharing art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/428f570ef00dd837e8b61b16c2942c01.poster.avif?t=1772996424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/428f570ef00dd837e8b61b16c2942c01.webm?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/428f570ef00dd837e8b61b16c2942c01.mp4?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience branching storylines with an array of odd characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk and explore a curated set of locations full of personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw objects in the world with a variety of tools and color palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift drawings to your neighbors. Each neighbor has an extensive set of custom responses based on what and how something was drawn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of an assortment of potted humans. Learn more about the potted human personalities by decorating their shelves according to their preferences and keeping them happy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and interact with lots of cats and other adorable creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock romance and friendship options\u00a0<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Contains mentions of drug use, suicide and self-harm.</i> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/8045b9671e2f9a905ed5b68c655dde27.poster.avif?t=1772996424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/8045b9671e2f9a905ed5b68c655dde27.webm?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/8045b9671e2f9a905ed5b68c655dde27.mp4?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038920?t=1772996424","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038920?t=1772996424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/f3acefd46e335792f38ad93a3a3fdda62e261eda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772996424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/f3acefd46e335792f38ad93a3a3fdda62e261eda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772996424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game describes acts of suicide, but it is not graphically depicted in game. There are also narratives about harassment and stalking."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.poster.avif?t=1772996424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.webm?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/ab86b7f2dfb60dd4250f997ad91d7c91.mp4?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of an anxious cactus artist named Prickles. Prickles is in a mentally dark place and faces eviction, but one call from her estranged aunt Big Red changes all of that. Prickles moves to a new apartment with the help of her aunt, hopefully to piece her life back together again. Prickles can help herself and the odd residents of the apartment complex through making and sharing art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/428f570ef00dd837e8b61b16c2942c01.poster.avif?t=1772996424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038920/extras/428f570ef00dd837e8b61b16c2942c01.webm?t=1772996424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc